(6684574, 999927, 93565, '<td valign="top">Very different approach to equine photography, and I sorta like that in and of itself. I''d wonder if this might be visually more abstract if you had stopped down in order to keep clarity in the background. Then, you would have two parts of a horse you don''t often see photographed along with the background, further complicating the scene. This might not fare well here on DPC, but I think it might be an interesting venture as an abstract.</td>', 'Very different approach to equine photography, and I sorta like that in and of itself. I''d wonder if this might be visually more abstract if you had stopped down in order to keep clarity in the background. Then, you would have two parts of a horse you don''t often see photographed along with the background, further complicating the scene. This might not fare well here on DPC, but I think it might be an interesting venture as an abstract.', '2012-02-20 06:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
