(6684583, 999737, 124190, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Love everything about this.   Composition, contrast, line up of the position of the fishies'' eyes, the dark scratches on their silvery bodies, the cellophane(?) or plastic under them on top of the tray.    Super! Best in the bunch.</td>', 'Beautiful!  Love everything about this.   Composition, contrast, line up of the position of the fishies'' eyes, the dark scratches on their silvery bodies, the cellophane(?) or plastic under them on top of the tray.    Super! Best in the bunch.', '2012-02-20 07:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
