(6684634, 999727, 93565, '<td valign="top">Bummer the focus seems on the wall behind (though, admittedly this could be because it''s a small version and is hard to tell. Great capture of the moment, in any case.</td>', 'Bummer the focus seems on the wall behind (though, admittedly this could be because it''s a small version and is hard to tell. Great capture of the moment, in any case.', '2012-02-20 07:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6684635, 999565, 12611, '<td valign="top">something that is both human woman and mystical faerie about this. Excellent shot.</td>', 'something that is both human woman and mystical faerie about this. Excellent shot.', '2012-02-20 07:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6684640, 1000047, 93565, '<td valign="top">Very nice lines, love the tones on the giraffe. The bits in the back are a bit distracting, but the giraffe is great.</td>', 'Very nice lines, love the tones on the giraffe. The bits in the back are a bit distracting, but the giraffe is great.', '2012-02-20 07:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6684641, 1000050, 12611, '<td valign="top">I am stuck staring at this shot trying to form words. Hey, its called evolution- "we''re up here little buddy!" or are we?</td>', 'I am stuck staring at this shot trying to form words. Hey, its called evolution- "we''re up here little buddy!" or are we?', '2012-02-20 07:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6684643, 999960, 93565, '<td valign="top">I love this photo and the different take it took upon the challenge. I think it also would''ve worked well as a BW, but in spite of the challenge, I''m going to vote this a 7.</td>', 'I love this photo and the different take it took upon the challenge. I think it also would''ve worked well as a BW, but in spite of the challenge, I''m going to vote this a 7.', '2012-02-20 07:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6684644, 999887, 12611, '<td valign="top">great title. makes the shot resonate for me.</td>', 'great title. makes the shot resonate for me.', '2012-02-20 07:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6684645, 999767, 12611, '<td valign="top">great choice on the flower tone- I am assuming some are negative about it but- it makes the shot very interesting and adds depth.</td>', 'great choice on the flower tone- I am assuming some are negative about it but- it makes the shot very interesting and adds depth.', '2012-02-20 07:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6684648, 999727, 12611, '<td valign="top">I love rodeo clowns. just on the line between bravery and foolhardy. like fireman wearing funny costumes as they save people.</td>', 'I love rodeo clowns. just on the line between bravery and foolhardy. like fireman wearing funny costumes as they save people.', '2012-02-20 07:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6684649, 998751, 93565, '<td valign="top">This would''ve had a lot more pop if the whites were pushed up a bit.</td>', 'This would''ve had a lot more pop if the whites were pushed up a bit.', '2012-02-20 07:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6684650, 999726, 12611, '<td valign="top">such texture! the compositional positioning and blur are spot on, too.</td>', 'such texture! the compositional positioning and blur are spot on, too.', '2012-02-20 07:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6684651, 1000101, 93565, '<td valign="top">Black subjects are not the easiest to give depth and detail, but you''ve done a marvelous job.</td>', 'Black subjects are not the easiest to give depth and detail, but you''ve done a marvelous job.', '2012-02-20 07:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6684652, 999351, 12611, '<td valign="top">great non-traditional use of a cat.</td>', 'great non-traditional use of a cat.', '2012-02-20 07:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6684657, 999742, 12611, '<td valign="top">The bent paw just makes the whole shot- If a human portrait is a reflection of the relationship or perceived experience between the photog and subject, and if we extrapolate that point to animal portraiture, it is clear that Maisy is comfortable with you.</td>', 'The bent paw just makes the whole shot- If a human portrait is a reflection of the relationship or perceived experience between the photog and subject, and if we extrapolate that point to animal portraiture, it is clear that Maisy is comfortable with you.', '2012-02-20 07:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6684658, 1000037, 12611, '<td valign="top">such a loaded title. fantastic.</td>', 'such a loaded title. fantastic.', '2012-02-20 07:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6684660, 999139, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like the fact that the specs get bigger as the eye goes up- rather than disappear into the void.</td>', 'I like the fact that the specs get bigger as the eye goes up- rather than disappear into the void.', '2012-02-20 07:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6684663, 999750, 93565, '<td valign="top">I get your sentiment and agree, sure, humans are animals, but this is perhaps less thoughtful than the hundred cat shots in the challenge, as we''re constantly around our children of this age even more than our pets, and I feel like children are shoehorned into any and everything.<br/>Photographically- I do very much like the drop on the nose, but visually this doesn''t say sick to me. I enjoy the photo as a photo of a youngster, but don''t think this is the challenge for it and feel like the title could have reinforced the image more instead of taking us somewhere I don''t think is present visually.</td>', 'I get your sentiment and agree, sure, humans are animals, but this is perhaps less thoughtful than the hundred cat shots in the challenge, as we''re constantly around our children of this age even more than our pets, and I feel like children are shoehorned into any and everything.Photographically- I do very much like the drop on the nose, but visually this doesn''t say sick to me. I enjoy the photo as a photo of a youngster, but don''t think this is the challenge for it and feel like the title could have reinforced the image more instead of taking us somewhere I don''t think is present visually.', '2012-02-20 07:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6684664, 1000037, 93565, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if its your editing, but that is the most garish bokeh I''ve seen. It reminds me of bacteria colonies on a petri dish.<br/>I''d try selecting the vulture for the sharpening on one layer, then applying a gaussian blur on the background bit.</td>', 'I don''t know if its your editing, but that is the most garish bokeh I''ve seen. It reminds me of bacteria colonies on a petri dish.I''d try selecting the vulture for the sharpening on one layer, then applying a gaussian blur on the background bit.', '2012-02-20 07:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6684665, 1000034, 93565, '<td valign="top">Very spooky, probably my favorite of the challenge. I love the light illuminated the suckers and accentuating the flexibility. Great shot. Hope to see this place higher up.<br/> <br/>ETA: Finished voting- this is my favorite.</td>', 'Very spooky, probably my favorite of the challenge. I love the light illuminated the suckers and accentuating the flexibility. Great shot. Hope to see this place higher up. ETA: Finished voting- this is my favorite.', '2012-02-20 07:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6684667, 999737, 93565, '<td valign="top">My second highest vote. I really just like the great contrast here. It''s a great study in tones, with the dead little fish staring blankly back at us. Very good.</td>', 'My second highest vote. I really just like the great contrast here. It''s a great study in tones, with the dead little fish staring blankly back at us. Very good.', '2012-02-20 07:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
