(6685538, 999914, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ha!  Not fond of having his portrait taken?   I like the composition with the fence/tree in the upper corner for balance - I LIKE shots that have context!</td>', 'Ha!  Not fond of having his portrait taken?   I like the composition with the fence/tree in the upper corner for balance - I LIKE shots that have context!', '2012-02-20 20:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
