(6685540, 1000099, 30982, '<td valign="top">What great looks from the dogs.  When "street shooting" you always get caught by the dogs and children.  Adults are oblivious.  This is an excellent example of that!</td>', 'What great looks from the dogs.  When "street shooting" you always get caught by the dogs and children.  Adults are oblivious.  This is an excellent example of that!', '2012-02-20 20:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
