(6685623, 999855, 65234, '<td valign="top">I actually rather like squirrels and you have some cool leading lines with the branches, but I think you could keep that concept and crop closer to better show off the squirrel, since it''s an animal challenge.  Highlights are a bit blown, though, so maybe you didn''t want to make that a bigger part of the image.</td>', 'I actually rather like squirrels and you have some cool leading lines with the branches, but I think you could keep that concept and crop closer to better show off the squirrel, since it''s an animal challenge.  Highlights are a bit blown, though, so maybe you didn''t want to make that a bigger part of the image.', '2012-02-20 21:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6685624, 1000043, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice!  Great patterned animals and I like the interaction.</td>', 'Nice!  Great patterned animals and I like the interaction.', '2012-02-20 21:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6685626, 999960, 65234, '<td valign="top">The animal is just a teeny part of the image, but still tells a cat-centric story.  Really like the overall composition.  Pretty interesting!</td>', 'The animal is just a teeny part of the image, but still tells a cat-centric story.  Really like the overall composition.  Pretty interesting!', '2012-02-20 21:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
