(6685791, 999852, 114285, '<td valign="top">Well I''m pretty sure I''ve picked one ribbon winner, and you are the other. Absolutely amazing to the max, I can''t fault it one bit. The zebra on the right is almost touchable, and I love how the other one is OOF. A FAVE.</td>', 'Well I''m pretty sure I''ve picked one ribbon winner, and you are the other. Absolutely amazing to the max, I can''t fault it one bit. The zebra on the right is almost touchable, and I love how the other one is OOF. A FAVE.', '2012-02-21 00:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
