(6691308, 1000034, 138630, '<td valign="top">Love the grace and play of light and shadow here and I must say the title takes it over the top.  Beautiful capture, well framed, and so effective in black and white.  One of my top picks.</td>', 'Love the grace and play of light and shadow here and I must say the title takes it over the top.  Beautiful capture, well framed, and so effective in black and white.  One of my top picks.', '2012-02-24 20:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
