(6691366, 999683, 138630, '<td valign="top">This guy is so cute -- great detail in the hairs around his face and I love the direct gaze and the composition.  Wish the eye area was lighter but it''s still one of my favorites in the competition.</td>', 'This guy is so cute -- great detail in the hairs around his face and I love the direct gaze and the composition.  Wish the eye area was lighter but it''s still one of my favorites in the competition.', '2012-02-24 21:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
