(6692356, 999177, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is one of my highest rated images in the contest.  I like the bright white of the bird against the darkness of the swamp surroundings.  The title is a perfect fit to how the image makes me feel when I see the beauty in the dark and seedy comfort of his stomping grounds.  I don''t mind the movement of the birds wings showing in the shot. (I can take it or leave it). The softness of the log in the foreground is a little bit of a bother to me though. I think is is an important part of the sceen and I would have made some of that fantastic detail stand out a little more.   Still, a stellar shot, and one of my favorites in this challenge.   Good luck with it!  I hope to see it on the front page when the challenge closes.</td>', 'This is one of my highest rated images in the contest.  I like the bright white of the bird against the darkness of the swamp surroundings.  The title is a perfect fit to how the image makes me feel when I see the beauty in the dark and seedy comfort of his stomping grounds.  I don''t mind the movement of the birds wings showing in the shot. (I can take it or leave it). The softness of the log in the foreground is a little bit of a bother to me though. I think is is an important part of the sceen and I would have made some of that fantastic detail stand out a little more.   Still, a stellar shot, and one of my favorites in this challenge.   Good luck with it!  I hope to see it on the front page when the challenge closes.', '2012-02-26 12:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6692371, 998725, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely light and detail,  and I really like the cat fading away softly into the darkness.  Really nice portrait.</td>', 'Lovely light and detail,  and I really like the cat fading away softly into the darkness.  Really nice portrait.', '2012-02-26 13:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6692372, 999005, 65234, '<td valign="top">Hysterical shot and title!  Not exactly a run-of-the-mill gorilla shot; much more entertaining, IMO.</td>', 'Hysterical shot and title!  Not exactly a run-of-the-mill gorilla shot; much more entertaining, IMO.', '2012-02-26 13:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6692373, 999956, 65234, '<td valign="top">Different sort of pose, though I suspect he was scratching himself with one of those long horns and not really all that concerned by photographic intrusion.  Love the backlighting.</td>', 'Different sort of pose, though I suspect he was scratching himself with one of those long horns and not really all that concerned by photographic intrusion.  Love the backlighting.', '2012-02-26 13:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
