(6692383, 999552, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very intrigued by this pose.  Quite dynamic.  Can''t help but notice the noise and some haloing (possibly sharpening artifacts) and think I''d prefer them gone, but really do love the composition and the bokeh.   This is one where the overall image has much more of an impact on me than the technicals.</td>', 'Very intrigued by this pose.  Quite dynamic.  Can''t help but notice the noise and some haloing (possibly sharpening artifacts) and think I''d prefer them gone, but really do love the composition and the bokeh.   This is one where the overall image has much more of an impact on me than the technicals.', '2012-02-26 13:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
