(6693053, 998734, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fascinating, Lydia.  I went to one of these in my late teens, and saw this EXACT same scene - except the little one looked straight up at me.  I never ate meat again.</td>', 'Fascinating, Lydia.  I went to one of these in my late teens, and saw this EXACT same scene - except the little one looked straight up at me.  I never ate meat again.', '2012-02-27 01:14:04.000000', NULL, 0),
