(6693064, 999775, 114233, '<td valign="top">I was hoping this would do much better! Its still a good score but I guess the voters didnt want an abstract shot probably wanted more of an animal shot. Regardless I think you should be proud of this shot - it is fantastic. The border makes the image and like <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=12611" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">blindjustice</a> said it works because of what is not in the frame. <br/>Print + Frame it!</td>', 'I was hoping this would do much better! Its still a good score but I guess the voters didnt want an abstract shot probably wanted more of an animal shot. Regardless I think you should be proud of this shot - it is fantastic. The border makes the image and like  blindjustice said it works because of what is not in the frame. Print + Frame it!', '2012-02-27 01:28:56.000000', NULL, 0),
