(6693117, 999744, 135744, '<td valign="top">Thank you everyone for the great votes! Very happy with the result though obviously one always would like to do better.<br/> <br/>@Aperture_Ready - good suggestion! I think I left it in as I felt it followed the angle of the heads but it could well look better without it - I will try it and see.</td>', 'Thank you everyone for the great votes! Very happy with the result though obviously one always would like to do better. @Aperture_Ready - good suggestion! I think I left it in as I felt it followed the angle of the heads but it could well look better without it - I will try it and see.', '2012-02-27 04:09:00.000000', NULL, 0),
